  "bodyHash": "635c6db30470a496",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">落叶消散</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 会在树木被砍倒后几乎立即使树叶腐烂。🍃 无需等待树叶缓慢消失，整个树冠通常在一秒内就会消散，仅留下树苗、树枝或果实，避免杂乱。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">本模组脱颖而出的原因在于其对性能和兼容性的专注。它能自动支持大多数模组树叶，依赖 Minecraft 原生的树叶腐烂机制，并避免了同类模组常见的额外计算。⚡</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">简单、快速且高度可配置，这是一款轻量级优化模组，能让砍伐木材的过程更加顺畅。🌳</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🍃 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">快速树叶腐烂：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 树木被砍倒后，树叶几乎会立即开始腐烂，通常在一秒内消失。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚡ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">专为性能打造：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 直接挂钩至 Minecraft 现有的树叶腐烂系统，无需进行不必要的额外计算。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">自动模组兼容：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 通过标准的 <code>minecraft:leaves</code> 标签开箱即用支持大多数模组树叶。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌳 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">兼容自定义树木：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 即使对于许多不直接扩展原版树叶方块的实现方式也能保持兼容。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💾 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">重载可靠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 使用 Minecraft 原生的定时刻系统，确保区块卸载和重载后树叶腐烂仍能正确继续。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可配置时间：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 自定义树叶开始腐烂的速度以及腐烂过程持续的时间。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🍂 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">灵活的腐烂规则：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 可选择允许树叶在连接到不同树叶类型时依然腐烂。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">服务端必须安装此模组</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Puzzles Lib</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (Fabric & NeoForge)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Fabric API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (Fabric)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config API Port</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (Fabric)</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模组支持配置，可直接在游戏内使用模组菜单进行设置（Fabric 平台需安装由 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\">Prospector</a> 开发的 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\">Mod Menu</a>）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有文件均位于 <code>.minecraft/config</code> 目录下，命名格式为 <code>MOD_ID-client.toml</code>、<code>MOD_ID-common.toml</code> 或 <code>MOD_ID-server.toml</code>，具体取决于配置文件类型。并非所有模组都会包含全部类型的文件，甚至可能没有任何配置文件。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/new-health-bars\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/healthbars/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mindful-darkness\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mindfuldarkness/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/slot-cycler\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/slotcycler/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
